 "notes": "Covers chromatin remodelling/nucleosome and pioneer-factor mechanism, histone-mark writers/readers/erasers incl. novel acylations (Kbhb, crotonylation, serotonylation, desuccinylation), Polycomb PRC1/PRC2 mechanism and condensates, enhancer/super-enhancer and enhancer-promoter regulation (ABC, CRISPRi, YY1, E-P proximity), 3D-genome loop-extrusion/CTCF/cohesin mechanism and topology-expression coupling, heterochromatin phase separation, X-inactivation (Xi structure, Xist-PRC1, escape), and reprogramming/early-embryo chromatin dynamics. DNA methylation/TET and genomic imprinting are thin in this recent window (only TET-Foxp3, plant demethylation, oxidative-base signalling, and one H3K27me3 imprinting paper), and Trithorax beyond MLL3/4 is essentially absent. Dropped all atlases/encyclopedias, profiling methods/software, epigenome-editing tools, pure interactome/landscape maps, genome assemblies, GWAS/EWAS/QTL, and trained-immunity/immunometabolism papers per the brief."
